      "content": "That feeling of losing your anchor is incredibly heavy, and it makes perfect sense that you feel adrift. When someone is so central to our identity, their absence can feel like an erasure of who we were. Searching for purpose right now is too much to ask, so please focus instead on small, gentle acts of self-care each day. Even tiny moments of connection or routine can start helping to build a new point of reference for yourself.",
      "source": "target",
