    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't want routine or self-care. i just want the emptiness to stop. it feels like we were two halves of a whole, and now i'm just a broken piece that doesn't fit anywhere. i feel so disconnected from the world... like i'm just stuck in this waiting room between here and wherever he is.",
