      "content": "It is completely valid to reject forced routine when you are in such deep pain, and the intensity of this separation feels unbearable. The feeling that you are a 'broken piece' speaks to a deep sense of incompleteness right now. Instead of trying to fill the emptiness, perhaps allow yourself to simply *be* in the waiting room without the pressure to move through it yet. Please consider reaching out for professional support, as a therapist can help you navigate this feeling of being suspended between worlds.",
